; A Hash tag that is a proper prefix of the computed hash is a mismatch,
; even though every character it has agrees with the expected hash.

2024/01/01 Test
    ; Hash: fbaef2581d47d8f4
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal --hashes sha512_half -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 7:
While parsing transaction:
> 2024/01/01 Test
>     ; Hash: fbaef2581d47d8f4
>     Expenses:Food    $10.00
>     Assets:Cash
Error: Expected hash fbaef2581d47d8f47b4e683db5c1191a2c3e3df8b0a21dba872d191082d4737e != fbaef2581d47d8f4
end test
